  <section class="mp-section" id="scope"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">01 / What you are buying</p><h2>A managed campaign.<br>Clear responsibilities.</h2><p>Choose an audience and business objective. Then define the research, outreach and sales support required to pursue it.</p></div>
    <div class="mp-scope-grid"><article><span class="mp-step">01</span><h3>Account and buyer definition</h3><p>Establish company criteria, relevant roles, territories, exclusions and the problem your offer can credibly address.</p><p class="mp-output"><strong>Working output</strong> An agreed audience and qualification standard.</p></article><article><span class="mp-step">02</span><h3>Research and contact preparation</h3><p>Activate usable records you already hold or scope fresh list development, validation and licensed data.</p><p class="mp-output"><strong>Working output</strong> Contacts prepared for the approved outreach.</p></article><article><span class="mp-step">03</span><h3>Calling and follow-up</h3><p>Start conversations, handle the first objections and work the next action. Explore the detail of our <a href="/services/b2b-cold-calling/">B2B cold calling services</a>.</p><p class="mp-output"><strong>Working output</strong> Recorded responses and owned follow-up.</p></article><article><span class="mp-step">04</span><h3>Qualification and appointments</h3><p>Test fit and business relevance before asking for a meeting. Identify what is known and what sales must still establish.</p><p class="mp-output"><strong>Working output</strong> An agreed discussion with useful context.</p></article><article><span class="mp-step">05</span><h3>CRM and calendar handoff</h3><p>Agree how meeting details, contact information, notes and confirmation reach the people responsible for progressing the sale.</p><p class="mp-output"><strong>Working output</strong> A prepared handoff and a named next owner.</p></article><article><span class="mp-step">06</span><h3>Reporting and campaign learning</h3><p>Review activity, conversations, attendance and sales feedback. Use what buyers actually say to refine the audience and approach.</p><p class="mp-output"><strong>Working output</strong> Evidence for the next campaign decisions.</p></article></div>
